# UI conventions (shadcn-style, light-only)

- Use `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, `text-muted-foreground`, etc. (CSS vars in `src/app/globals.css`).
- Prefer `src/components/ui/*` primitives over hand-rolled button/input classes.
- Do not introduce `dark:` classes or any dark-mode CSS.
- User-facing UI copy should be **Turkish** across the app.
- Prefer consistent layout patterns:
  - Page wrapper: `min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground`
  - Content width: `max-w-4xl` (or `max-w-3xl` for auth/onboarding)
- Icons: use `lucide-react` only.

